    "detailed_description": "Ending Tau is an action roguelite where curses morph your body changing the core mechanics of your journey. Combining unique mechanics with a fresh setting, Tau brings a new tone to the roguelike genre's experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVERY UPGRADE IS A GAME-CHANGER</strong></h2>Every curse drastically changes your gameplay in each run, from how you fight to how you walk (or fly) around the world.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/32f5bd94a88256fb7c7add1a6a22917e.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/32f5bd94a88256fb7c7add1a6a22917e.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/32f5bd94a88256fb7c7add1a6a22917e.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENDLESS MIX AND MATCH</strong></h2>Combine upgrades in whichever way you like. Stack them on top of each other and break the game's combat with insane builds. The unique upgrade system was designed to be simple yet meaningful. Combinations are endless.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/8f31518067a324f62fbd7332dfe1077e.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/8f31518067a324f62fbd7332dfe1077e.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/8f31518067a324f62fbd7332dfe1077e.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UNIQUE LANDSCAPES</strong></h2>Wander through a procedural world inspired by unique landscapes. Battle dozens of deadly folkloric creatures in a fast-paced combat system where any mistake is fatal. Unravel new secrets every time you enter the jungle. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/865a24eb910214a5cd9c28447e4cd76a.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/865a24eb910214a5cd9c28447e4cd76a.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/865a24eb910214a5cd9c28447e4cd76a.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASSIVE BOSS FIGHTS</strong></h2>Legend has it that <strong>Tau</strong> fathered seven sons: the seven <strong>Godfiends</strong>. Defeat them in grandiose boss fights that will require skill and strategy from every player.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9c519f31cae622e7356493fc02b8aa9b.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9c519f31cae622e7356493fc02b8aa9b.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9c519f31cae622e7356493fc02b8aa9b.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WORLD-BUILDING</strong></h2>Rebuild your village, unlock dozens of unique relics and skills and find powerful allies to aid you in your journey.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MYSTERIOUS LORE</strong></h2>Why are you the only being capable of resisting curses? What is <strong>Tau's</strong> true intent? Who's waiting for you in the depths of the jungle? Discover a refreshing story inspired by a legend from ancient Native American Folklore.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
