ssets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/2ddb3dfc77b975d7cfc4d555ddd68aaf.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MYSTERIOUS LORE</strong></h2>Why are you the only being capable of resisting curses? What is <strong>Tau's</strong> true intent? Who's waiting for you in the depths of the jungle? Discover a refreshing story inspired by a legend from ancient Native American Folklore.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.poster.avif?t=1747336092\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.webm?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2087880/extras/9f0b56f12fa4fb57994faa398273fb01.mp4?t=1747336092\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
